Cell["\<\
A uniform map lies on the surface of the map it is built on: the uniform maps \
{3, 7, 3, 7}, {3, 14, 14} and {4, 6, 14}, built on the first maps {3, 7} and \
{7, 3}, all lie on the Klein quartic, of genus 3.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"197bd67d-020b-4f5b-84a2-c0eaa8093943"],

