 "The genus of the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th map is 1 \[Minus] ",
 StyleBox["V \[Kappa]", "TI"],
 "/2: the first map {4, 6, 14} has 336 vertices of curvature \[Minus]1/84."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"febe5623-a715-428c-a005-e92dd4844a2c"],

