Cell["\<\
A graph does not determine its map, so the type must be the map's. The first \
map {5, 5} has the graph of the icosahedron: read as {5, 5} it has genus 4, \
read as {3, 5} genus 0.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"53557880-3160-4fb2-aaba-7ceb1480f580"],

